
    <h2 style="color: blue;">Why Mountain Biking Is The best Sport</h2>
    <img src="biking.jpeg" height="300" width="250" alt="Mountain Biking Action" id="biking"/>
    <p>Mountain biking is an exhilarating outdoor activity that combines adventure, speed, and skill.
        It is a hobby I took up at 16. I have consistently gone since. Even on the mission I found 
        members who loved to bike and would take me every Monday. I currently ride each week and train for races.</p>
    <br>
    <p>Here’s a picture taken 5 minutes before I ate it on a jump:</p>
    <img src="groupbike.jpeg" height="384" width="512" alt="Group Biking"/>

    <h2>Reasons to Bike:</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>A: It's awesome</li>
        <li>B: You get cool scars</li>
        <li>C: Your wife will constantly worry about your safety bc you're a little reckless</li>
    </ul>
